    "description": {
      "value": "This polished crystal sphere enhances scrying magic. Any visual information received through a spell with the scrying trait that was cast by the crystal ball appears within the sphere, and any auditory information sounds out from the surface of the sphere. When you cast a scrying spell by any other means while holding the sphere, you can relay any information you receive in the same way, allowing others to see or hear the target.\n\nThe base version of a crystal ball is a sphere of clear quartz, but other versions are made of different stones.\n\n- **Activate:** minute\n\nThe crystal ball casts clairvoyance to your specifications.\n\n- **Activate:** minute\n- **Frequency:** twice per day\n\nThe crystal ball casts a DC 33 scrying spell to your specifications.\n\nScrying is DC 39 and gives you the benefits of telepathy for communicating with the target."
    },
